[h2]Build 0.9.129[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]SloppyMod Trash POWER![/b]: the industrial repair center joins the exhaust pipe network. Pipe it to an open, powered exhaust port and its toxic repair waste is vented there as toxic gas and a little ground pollution instead of filling its waste container. With no port open it goes into the network's expansion tanks; only what neither can take ends up in the container. Waste already in the container is vented too once it is piped.
[*]Unpiped, or without Trash POWER!, the waste container works exactly as before.
[/list]
